    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "description": "High-level overview of what this dashboard measures and why it matters.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## GitHub Copilot Usage & Adoption Deep Dive\n\nThis dashboard focuses on **who is using Copilot, how they are using it, and where adoption is strongest**.\n\n**Leadership:** understand utilization, inactive seats, and where adoption is still shallow.  \n**Teams:** compare features, IDEs, languages, and models to see where enablement should focus.  \n**Developers:** understand which usage patterns correlate with deeper engagement and acceptance.\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
